      "mergedPostDetails": "Chatboxes appear inside users' heads rather than \"above\" or \"forward\". Normally this means that they are unreadable to everyone in the lobby.\n\nThis often results in an awkward dance of leaning up over the other user or transgressing their personal space to \"get inside their head\" so to speak...",
